[{"client_msg_id":"8ff6a99c-38ab-4a06-b2c0-b261fffb2326","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"表現が大変不適切だったので自主削除。","ts":"1629895990.297000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Qm3l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1576322-9092-4e03-b997-2f5dbe8d0018","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"（そろそろ脳波通話が実用化されてもいいのではと思ってる）","ts":"1629895226.295900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I7Zpe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"048dc4e0-f65c-4b64-aac9-1a9fec13cfc8","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"どちらにしろVC前提だとやっぱり障壁が高い感じですね…。","ts":"1629895200.295400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dxn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9A93104E-5C90-48E8-81F1-C502BAC30873","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"短めで120+15かな\n広めのマップなら慣れてて135+15","ts":"1629895146.294800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pF0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E8D18D01-7509-469D-AD8A-3B46C4026B0A","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"120から慣れてなかったら180以上もあり","ts":"1629895063.293100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ivr7L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ad13068-1ab9-41cc-8ed0-ed3fc1261b97","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"カップラーメン作れないと考えると短い","ts":"1629895057.293000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vZxi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"444906FB-5445-409C-959B-C865054279AE","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"120は短いですよ","ts":"1629895034.292100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FU0K7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddd28933-404b-46c0-abc7-4f10ee4b1d4a","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"最長120秒（2分）らしいですが、確かに少し短いかも。","ts":"1629894484.291700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cOBnh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31e9ccc9-a2b5-4d5b-ab6b-c2843c10d483","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"開始時の設定で変更できますが、だいたい1分から1分半ですね","ts":"1629894418.290800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5JS7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcdb76a4-dca7-42b5-a0c5-8cd5de704a51","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"確か一分でしたっけ？","ts":"1629894267.290200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uRgG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff1f6312-0b0e-462f-8fef-acdba0acda9d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"時間内に話し合いをしなきゃいけないのと、ゲーム内チャットは見にくいのとが…","ts":"1629894166.289800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hlNs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4409cba5-0d21-463b-84e2-d62d90d4f016","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"むしろVCなど不要というゲームならあるんですけどね。「Move or Die」と言うんですが。","ts":"1629892690.289000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"63lqQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6508e5f0-d099-4c82-8385-112e39d6bc6f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"それは自分も要望していたんですが、今のところどうしてもVCありじゃないとキツいという話ばかりだったので…。","ts":"1629892396.288200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nSK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3daf51e2-62e8-4243-b3ae-322c3f01eec6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"VC なしでプレイできるんだったらもうちょっと参加障壁下がりそうなんだけど…","ts":"1629891592.287100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F6H"}]},{"client_ms